[0.008, "o", "\u001b[25B\u001b[0m============================================================\u001b[27;1H Demo 3: what a build leaves behind\u001b[28;1H \b\n One build, from source to a signed image, and then the\u001b[30;1H evidence for it: who signed, with which key, and where the\u001b[31;1H \u001b[H\u001b[30B transparency log recorded it. Nothing shown at the end is\u001b[32;1H what the controller assumes; it is read back from the\u001b[33;1H registry and from Rekor.\u001b[34;1H============================================================\u001b[35;1H \u001b[H"]
